  src/components/feature-comparison-table.tsx
  src/i18n/                         Bilingual dictionaries (en / zh)
  src/lib/pricing.ts                Public pricing constants
  src/middleware.ts                 Locale routing
  src/app/[locale]/                 Website routes (plaza home, pricing, privacy, docs)
  public/                           Static assets
  assets/                           README images

Research SKILL templates (Docker-wrapped open-source tools):

  templates/nature-academic-search/   Academic Search SKILL (PubMed / CrossRef / arXiv)
  templates/<your-skill>/             New research SKILLs contributed via PR *
                                      Must include medskill.json + Dockerfile + run.sh

  * Community-contributed directories under templates/ that follow the
    medskill.json specification and are merged via pull request are
    licensed MIT unless otherwise noted in that directory.

Developer tooling:

  mcp-server/                       MCP server for Cursor / Claude (list & run SKILLs)

Local development infrastructure:

  docker-compose.yml                Qdrant + Redis + Postgres for local dev
  .env.local.example
  tailwind.config.ts
  tsconfig.json
  package.json                      Scripts for local dev & SKILL builds (see Appendix B
                                    for proprietary workspace packages)

Shared UI components (usable with Community Edition):

  src/components/ui/
  src/components/copy-command.tsx
  src/app/globals.css
  src/app/layout.tsx
  src/app/sitemap.ts

Documentation:

