--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
APPENDIX C — CLOUD SERVICES (NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following capabilities are offered only as hosted services at
https://www.mland.io or under a commercial agreement. They are not included
in this open-source release:

  - Cloud SKILL runtime (GPU scheduling, job queue, container orchestration)
  - User accounts, authentication, and compute-coin billing
  - Contributor revenue share settlement
  - Pro encrypted storage and extended result retention
  - Lab team workspaces and advisor approval flows
  - Custom SKILL packaging as a managed service

Self-hosting Appendix A components is free under MIT. Running the full
hosted plaza experience requires a Pro, Lab, or commercial plan.

